{"displayStem":"NK세포 기능을 대조군과 비교하였다. 세포 수와 생존율을 맞추고 같은 표적세포를 사용하였다. 표적 자극 후 CD107a 노출, 세포 내 단백질, 최종 살상을 측정하였다. 각 점은 독립 배양 웰이며 동일 환자의 반복이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>표적세포 살상</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"표적세포 살상。효과기:표적 비율、표적세포 사멸 (%)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">표적세포 사멸 (%)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6.25</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">12.5</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">18.75</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">25</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">50</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">75</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><circle cx=\"164\" cy=\"191.8684\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"164\" cy=\"183.81220000000002\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"164\" cy=\"186.631\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"148.9078\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"142.0174\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"252\" cy=\"145.3234\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"428\" cy=\"97.0384\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"428\" cy=\"90.77440000000001\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"428\" cy=\"96.84699999999998\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">대조</text><rect x=\"160.8\" y=\"220.3538\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"160.8\" y=\"215.7254\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"160.8\" y=\"217.6742\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"248.8\" y=\"212.0192\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"248.8\" y=\"211.4102\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"248.8\" y=\"215.27300000000002\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"424.8\" y=\"206.15540000000001\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"424.8\" y=\"207.23420000000002\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"424.8\" y=\"202.6232\" width=\"6.4\" height=\"6.4\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></rect><rect x=\"327\" y=\"298\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\